      B22: the archive tab drew NOTHING on a cold open and on a failed first page — same
      predicate, same void, as the two list screens. `refresh_error` is the only new sentence.

      There is deliberately no `paging_error` here: this screen reads `loadState.append` nowhere,
      so it has no append tail to give a reason to, and an unused string is exactly what
      `UnusedResources` exists to catch. The missing tails are recorded for the archive mapping.
    -->
